WEBVTT

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.530
Bye-bye, Ichiko.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.620
Don't be too hard on the normal Momiji, okay? For me.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:53.000
H-Hold it right there!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.300
Ichiko!

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.220
Don't get any ideas.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:11.940
Having you be like this is much better for me than having you return to being a God of Misfortune.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.360
And there's no way I'd be able to get along with that God of Misfortune, anyway!

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:18.820
That's why...

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:22.530
I won't let you become a God of Misfortune!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.580
Wait, Ichiko!

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.590
Ichiko!

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:35.130
What?!

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.630
You can't use the Soumin Shourai right now, can you?

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.630
Oh, shit!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.300
Hey there!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.850
R-Ranmaru?

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.640
What do you two think you're doing?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.980
Same for you, Ranmaru...

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.020
Well, I'm just thinking that I could see your house from where I was...

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.280
and then you two came flying out the window!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.280
Imagine my surprise!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.030
We're the ones that are surprised...

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.530
Ranmaru, exactly how far did you jump just now?

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.490
We won't let you get away!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.580
The hell are you doing?!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:13.580
Ranmaru! Let's just run away for now!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.880
You want me to turn my back to an opponent?!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.920
Please! Ranmaru!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.050
Fine, I guess...

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.800
I don't really know what's going on, but hold on tight!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.180
About that, Mr. Teddy...

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:33.440
My nose has been knocked out from the stink of all that trash...

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:37.860
Just give me a second, please... just until my nose clears up.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.490
So if she gets dirty, she'll return to the normal Momiji?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.790
The hell is that?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.960
It might sound ridiculous, but that's how it is.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.080
I don't know if it's true either,

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.420
but she only ended up like this after that bath.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.550
So doing the opposite will turn her back?

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:04.470
I won't allow it! What kind of man tries to soil a woman with trash?!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.390
But what should we do?

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:10.310
It's not like we can keep running forever.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.190
It's okay.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.770
By sunset tonight...

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.610
As long as we can survive until tonight,

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.780
they should stop... I think.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.400
Why?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.160
Even a dog's nose won't be able to find us by then?

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:25.910
I guess...

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.410
Damn whipper snappers!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.170
The hell you thinkin', jumping out so recklessly?!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.800
Oh, well look who it is.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.130
What's with that truck, monk?

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.890
I started delivering for a sake shop last week.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.180
Oh! Good timing, Bobby!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.020
Take us to the next town! It doesn't matter where!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.980
I don't really know why, but as long as we can survive until tonight, we win, right?

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.270
Great idea!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.740
Now just wait a second, I told you I'm working right now!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.650
Come on! One or two hours can't hurt!

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.160
No! No! No!

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.870
I don't have time to be caught up in selfish, childish pursuits!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:15.870
Fine then! If you help us escape, I'll let you touch my boobs or whatever else you want!

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.750
Play me the fool!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:22.340
Say that from the get-go!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:28.050
Come on! Let's fly, monk!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.430
Is this okay, Ichiko?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.510
What?

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.100
To think you're willing to lose your virginity to such a...

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.350
personification of lust and sexual desire, for my sake!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.360
Nobody said that!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.480
Pinch the dials and press the buttons!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:48.200
And like I said before, getting you away is for my own sake.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:51.740
I only think of myself.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.960
That's right. That's fine.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:03.960
I've often told you to use your Fortune for other people, but what you've said is what's important.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:09.470
People who only think of others will someday lead themselves to destruction.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:17.770
You used to place Kurumi's happiness over your own, even though you should have known what would happen.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.440
H-How do you...

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.020
So, Ichiko...

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:32.280
If this is what you really want from the bottom of your heart, I'll always be by your side.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:37.370
N-Now wait a second, I never said I wa—

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:44.050
You two are always fighting... yet to think this day would never come...!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.090
Oi, you three!

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.760
Sorry to interrupt your fun,

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.380
but something's coming.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.850
Oh no, it's the trashzooka from before!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.430
Bobby, dodge it!

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.480
Aye, sir!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.650
He doesn't care about collateral damage!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.530
Mr. Teddy! Please launch me!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.450
Prepare yourselves!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.080
Get lost!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.000
Da hell is dis?

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.130
All right... let's go for one more round!

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.180
That's right!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.680
What's up, Ranmaru?

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.430
Think about it! If only Momiji needs to escape,

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:40.140
then we don't have to go with her, do we?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.020
I guess so...

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.650
In that case, I'll take this one!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.730
Ranmaru!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:53.950
Those inhuman scoundrels that seek to tear apart the bonds between women...

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.160
The loving bonds of friendship that connect us...

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.870
I will shoulder fate itself to crush those who seek to destroy it.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.910
Come, wretched hound!

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:03.330
I'll be your opponent from now on!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.380
Filthy human...

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.800
You're in deep trouble if you think I'll go easy on you just because you're a girl.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.170
Just how I want it.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.220
I wouldn't want you to have any excuses when you lose!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.850
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.180
<i>He's strong!</i>

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.900
Please go ahead, Mr. Teddy!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.450
I'll catch up as soon as I take care of this one!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.080
You're the one getting ahead of yourself!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:48.540
Ranmaru!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.130
How's that?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.640
Not bad.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:03.140
What?! Did it feel better than I thought it would?

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.150
Th-That's playing dirty!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:10.780
There's no way I can hit you when you're like that!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.740
Turn back, now!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.530
...I'll turn back.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:15.240
Huh?

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.990
If you hit me, I'll turn back! Come on!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.910
What's with this guy?! Creep!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.910
A punch or a kick would be fine! Please do it harder!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:26.830
What?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.380
The Soumin Shourai has been sealed away?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.420
Yeah. Don't you have any other tools?

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:35.380
Teddy seems really serious this time.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.340
Guess there's no way around it.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.550
Here, special on the house.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:40.350
And this is?

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.560
It houses some of my power.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.730
Its name is... "Jazz the Hyper!"

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:48.520
Put it on your legs, and your speed levels up!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:52.230
Put it up to your eyes, and you have clairvoyance. Mm, very nice.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.780
You depraved deviant!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:58.570
Bobby, you really make some neat stuff, but how come your mind is always in the gutter?

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:00.620
Anyway, I'm putting it on now.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.160
So you're here, Teddy!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.540
Kitty! You're going to help?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.170
Bobby! I'll leave her to you!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.420
10-4 for tits! Roger that!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:18.220
Ichiko... Be careful out there.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:22.220
Don't make me repeat myself again!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.100
This isn't for you!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.810
<i>Amazing! I feel like Ranmaru!</i>

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.610
Kitty!

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.700
You shall not pass, Teddy!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.090
I-Ignorant? What are you talking about?

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:04.350
"If a God of Misfortune is cleaned and loses her powers for seven days and seven nights..."

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:10.940
"They'll become human"? What do you mean?

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.070
A doll?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:23.320
"In order to communicate with humans, gods possess a human-like doll."

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:28.870
"If we don't, humans can't converse or even see us."

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:32.750
"And if her powers aren't returned by the deadline..."

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.960
"...she won't be able to return to normal."

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.590
"When that happens, her personality can never change back."

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.970
"In other words, for the God of Misfortune Momiji, that means..."

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.280
Death?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.740
Then that means she'll...

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.700
Wait, Teddy, where are you—

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.290
W-Wait, Teddy...

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.630
<i>Why didn't she tell us?</i>

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:21.090
<i>Is she all right with this? Isn't this important?</i>

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:23.880
<i>If she disappears...</i>

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.550
<i>What is this...</i>

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.760
<i>How can this...</i>

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.730
<i>If I knew this from the beginning...</i>

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.310
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:37.770
<i>Wait a second.</i>

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.780
<i>If I knew this from the beginning, then what?</i>

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.400
Oh, you're alive.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.110
Huh?

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.870
Tsuwabuki!

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.710
Geez, what're you doing? Don't surprise me like that!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.960
That's what I should be saying...

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.540
What're you doing here?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.590
I was just, uh...

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.090
Taking a nap!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.800
How dignified of you.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.550
Same goes for you. What're you doing here?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.550
I'm in the middle of work.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:14.270
I got your monk friend Bobby a job as a deliveryman,

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.190
but he hasn't come back yet.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.270
I'm covering his ass.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:18.980
Oh!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.940
What do you mean, "oh?"

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.480
N-Nothing!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.700
Anyway, I have to get going.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.360
Sure.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.240
Later!

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:32.910
I "have to go?" So I go after them... and then what?

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:36.000
Stop Teddy? But if I do that...

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:40.540
Ah, wait, Tsuwabuki!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.250
Huh?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.130
I want to ask you something.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.840
Th-This is all hypothetical, okay?

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.260
If I knew someone really annoying,

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:53.720
and said I really hate them,

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.190
and always wished they'd go away,

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.440
but if I found out that they were really going to disappear...

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.360
I don't know which is better.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:12.330
If I think about her being gone, I get this buzzing in my chest...

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:17.660
So... What... What should I do?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:22.290
Is this person, what, transferring or something?

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.340
You could say that.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.010
But you won't be able to see them ever again?

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.340
Probably...

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.890
So you're not going to say goodbye?

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.010
I said this is hypothetical!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.270
You already know the answer to that, don't you?

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:44.400
If you were really okay with this person being gone, you wouldn't be this upset, would you?

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:48.320
I'm... upset?

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.110
Looks like it to me.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:54.410
You're upset, he says! You had that brain function?!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.120
God damn it, this so messed up!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.630
I'm getting really angry for some reason!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:08.970
That's right! Why the hell am I doing all this for her, anyway?

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:15.560
Looks like you're feeling better.
You looked pretty down recently.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:20.640
Maybe you were down, or maybe just very calm.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:26.230
Yeah... that's right. Maybe.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.280
Oh...

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.780
Now that I think about it, Tsuwabuki...

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:34.320
You saw me naked the other day!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.530
You're too loud.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:42.790
But since you answered my question, we'll call it even.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.800
Good job, Tsuwabuki!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:49.300
What? Okay...

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.430
All right then, I'm off.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:53.840
Okay.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.680
Amazing, she is.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.270
<i>What.. that was it?</i>

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.730
<i>Did it really take me this long to realize?</i>

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.860
Goodness! What was that?

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.580
How do I get down?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.750
Ichiko!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.290
Teddy...

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.170
That girl...

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.930
Ichiko has really changed.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:39.640
She's become so kind to the people around her.

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:45.810
Yes, we can always solve the problem by forcibly taking her Fortune.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.520
But if we do that, Ichiko will be unhappy.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:56.200
But if Ichiko chooses to share her Fortune, then everyone will be happy!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:17:02.700
That's why I wanted to stay by Ichiko's side,
to support her using her Fortune for other people!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.500
There are plenty of other Gods of Misfortune.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:12.260
But not just anyone can guide her.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.090
Teddy...

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.470
<i>No... way...</i>

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.520
<i>Is this... the end?</i>

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.230
<i>I'm sorry, Teddy...</i>

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.320
<i>I'm sorry, Ichiko...</i>

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.760
Ichiko...

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:59.470
Seriously... you tell others to think about their own happiness,

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.430
but what about yourself?!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:06.480
Erasing your god persona and becoming a human... is that happiness for you?!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.440
B-But...

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:09.350
But what?!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:14.360
I thought... I thought that would be for the best...

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:19.610
Man, dirty or clean, you really don't change do you? Always doing whatever you want...

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.410
I'll be the one to decide what's best for me.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:26.040
Besides, I finally realized.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:33.130
When you go crazy, I feel at peace.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.050
Bye-bye, Momiji.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:45.140
Ichiko... that was the first time.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.020
You called me by my name for the first time...

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:53.940
A boat!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.440
We can get away with this!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:19:00.450
No... Miss Momiji!

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.450
Huh? Wait a second... that boat is...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:10.290
Hm? You heard me.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.170
She's meant to be crazy.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:19.470
If she disappeared like this and left our score unsettled, I wouldn't like it either.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.930
I still have to settle this,

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.810
and chase her out of the human world!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:38.990
Been a while! How ya feelin'?

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.570
Ah... the worst.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.620
Just thinking about it makes me want to curse myself into oblivion.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:49.200
Me too.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:53.040
To think I got upset over you for even a second.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.710
Makes me want to puke!

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:01.300
Dear me... you really are

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.680
naïve, aren't you?

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.850
First the incident with Tsuwabuki,

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:11.560
and this time you had the perfect chance to drive me away...

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.940
And what was that? You were upset? Over me?

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.230
Even though you lack the brain capacity?

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.320
Ridiculous!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:18.980
Why, you...

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.530
Want me to wash you again and finish the job?!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.370
Oh, scary! And just when I finally got you to call me by my name!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.370
I said that to the other you because you asked me to!

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:33.670
The truth is, all that was just an act so I could tear down the walls around your heart—

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.000
Liar!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:35.630
Yay! She's back! Miss Momiji!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:38.340
Ichiko... You couldn't protect her after all?

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.420
Huh? But...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.550
Why...

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:48.100
Why do you look so happy?

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:51.180
Oh, that's right. I saw your flatboard for the first time.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.520
Shut! Your! Mouth!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:56.060
That's not even flat, that's a <i>depression</i>.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.230
Shut the fuck up! And you're more like a monster!

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.070
Who's chest you calling monstrous?!

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.990
And I don't want to hear you calling anyone else a monster!

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:06.160
Shut up, you autistic slut!

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.450
Let go!

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.530
Shut up!

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:09.580
Why, you...

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:13.290
Binbougami ga!!!

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:49.300
<i>Huh? Feels like I'm forgetting something...</i>

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:56.890
Bobby, the monk arrested for driving with a forged license and causing property damage a few days ago:

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:01.940
"The voice of the great God of Breasts spoke to me. I had to do it, she said I could touch her titties!"

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:05.440
Saying such mysterious things, the monk...

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:13.450
In Butsumetsu City, enemies spring up one after another!

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:16.830
And the one to face them? It is I, Adenokouji Nadeshiko!

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:19.960
The second season of Binbougami ga! Darkness!

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:20.960
Look forward to it!
